# Whitelist: the repository carries code, the report and the curated public
# results only. Survey records (donors/), releases (data/), the private
# calibration artifact and build record (prereqs/), Microcosm and populace
# checkouts (code/, src/), run logs, raw run outputs (results/*, which carry
# production-side totals over SPI-derived rows) and anything private stay out.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt
!/REPORT.md
!/harness/
!/inventory/
!/results/
/results/*
!/results/public/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.hypothesis/
.pytest_cache/
